                                 owl:onDataRange xsd:anyURI
                               ] ;
               <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/description> """The XBRLReport class captures prepared XBRL reports for the organization. It is linked from FinancialInformation through hasXBRLReport. It has the following properties:
●	forYear1: URI linking to the prepared report for Year 1.
●	forYear2: URI linking to the prepared report for Year 2.
●	forYear3: URI linking to the prepared report for Year 3."""@en ;
               rdfs:comment "Prepared XBRL reports for the organization."@en .


